          [
            "wesnoth-utbs",
            "In the distant future a small band of elves struggles to survive amidst the ruins of fallen empires. Lead your people out of the desert on an epic journey to find a new home.\n\n"
          ],
          [
            "wesnoth-utbs",
            "Note: This campaign changes some standard mechanics, such as the day/night cycle, recall costs and general approach to the difficulty levels. The Quenoth elves include units that can attack several times per turn, and others that can move after attacking."
          ],
          "\n\n",
